    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> be three vectors such that the projection vector of <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math> . If <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> , then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
