  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
